      { "id": "p2", "from": "a9", "to": "a10" }
    ],
    "commentary": {
      "points": [
        "1 carries to the contact and stays down with the ball, presented back",
        "2 and 3 arrive, bind over the ball and hold the ruck",
        "9 only gets the ball once the first support is at the ruck, then passes to 10",
        "The ruck breaks up only when the ball is away: then everyone walks back"
      ]
